            <div xml:id="d736">

                <pb facs="1031" n="911" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg911"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/2642: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the Technical Board</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stevens</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-08-17T10:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">August 17,
                                1922—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 10:30
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is reported from Japanese sources that granting of control over the Chinese
                    Eastern Railway to the mythical Government of China is approved by the Powers. I
                    trust this report is incorrect. Russian interests would be completely betrayed
                    by such action. The Manchurian government is Chang Tso-lin …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stevens</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
